{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1287239-cofd-streams","id":1287239,"title":"CofD Streams","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-12T14:10:50-08:00","id":1287239,"title":"CofD Streams","content":"Hi guys,<br /> <br /> I've been really enjoying LA by Night on Geek &amp; Sundry. And it got me thinking: has Onyx Path ever tried/considered organising some official streamed actual plays?<br /> <br /> I for one would be all over a well done short Chronicle for most of their games. Both from an entertainment perspective as well as seeing how to &quot;properly&quot; run things.<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3192-baileyborough","name":"baileyborough","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-12T14:59:41-08:00","id":1287273,"title":"","content":"It's certainly something that would be interesting to see. I've considered doing a new Forsaken game and seeing if OPP'd be interested in supporting getting it out there, but the base costs of getting the gear etc to do a proper streaming job is a bit of a stumbling block - unlike these online content creator types, we mere rpg writers aren't rolling in cash :P<br /> <br /> I've done a few podcasts of my games in the past but as simple, unedited recordings of just my home table game, I wouldn't feel comfortable pushing them as being of the quality and entertainment needed to really do a proper streamed example justice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u2